<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs-Wednesday actual 106,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs-Wednesday actual 106,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts for Wednesday were 106,000 head, compared with the estimate of 110,000, USDA said. Opening trade was not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts were steady with midsession Wednesday.</p>
